Node ID=36 brother
Text=<He does not stop chewing.> His grace the Bishop, same as you, presumably. It is a good test and it costs the Church nothing: a Cathar perfect would sooner starve than eat what I am eating, and half of them cannot help saying so. Sit down, have some, and do not stand over me looking clever -- you are drawing eyes.
